{
  "description": "Final proposed label set for intel/torch-xpu-ops (label-issue skill), organized by category. Includes proposed labels plus existing repo labels unchanged by this proposal. 'origin' records where each label comes from; when an old label maps/renames/merges into a label, the source is named in that label's origin.",
